  "details": "Many worlds that have a lot of people in a small place enforce rules that worn avatars must be above a certain rank to maintain reasonable performance for everyone. This is currently done using human moderation which is not always available / practical. By having the ability in Udon to check your current avatars performance rank (Possibly through VrcPlayerApi) We could make moderation systems to prevent users from entering an event room until they switch to a proper avatar, making things easier and more convenient for everyone",
